<VI _name="Spike Step Number.vi" description="Spike step c: edits the numeric labelled Label (default Number) with posted input only - a click at 3/4 of its width (the digital display\2C right of the increment buttons)\2C WM_KEYDOWN/UP End\2C one WM_CHAR per character of Digits\2C WM_KEYDOWN/UP Enter. Waits Settle ms and reads the value back. Pass when it equals Expected. Any error skips the rest.">
